15. [sẽ chạy] Bật /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/tpan-b.example.com.conf → /etc/nginx/sites-available/tpan-b.example.com.conf  (symlink:/etc/nginx/sites-enabled/tpan-b.example.com.conf)
